Modifications
-------------

Copyright (C) 2026 the author of this fork.

Released under the GNU General Public License, version 3.0, as required by section 5 of
that licence. The changes are described in CHANGELOG.md; in short:

  * correct 0-based diagnostic ranges (edulint reports 1-based columns)
  * run edulint through execFile with an argument array instead of a shell string
  * tolerate different shapes of the Python extension's getExecutionDetails() result
  * raise the child-process output limit and stop treating unparseable output as fatal
  * report linting failures in the Problems panel instead of failing silently
  * attach edulint's explanations, with a quick fix to open them
  * add settings, a keybinding, an editor title button and an update check
  * cancel superseded runs so stale results cannot overwrite newer ones

